# AgriMitra frontend config (optional — vanilla site, no build step)
# Only needed when the frontend is served SEPARATELY from the backend.
# The preferred setup is: run `node backend/server.js` and open http://localhost:5000 (same origin, no config).
# Otherwise set the backend base URL before app scripts load, e.g. in browser console or a local config script:
#   window.AGRIMITRA_API_BASE = "http://localhost:5000";
# Server-side keys live ONLY in backend/.env — never put API keys in frontend files.
